<</if>>
<<if _robin.dom gte 40>>
	"I'm so glad we're out of there!" <<if $robinromance is 1>><<He>> holds your head against <<his>> shoulder and runs a hand through your hair.<<else>><<He>> holds you close, taking your hands in <<his>> own and squeezing tightly.<</if>>
<<else>>
	"We did it! We're free!" <<He>> buries <<his>> head in your shoulder.
<</if>>
<<He>> breaks the hug, taking your hand in <<hers>>. "Let's go home," <<he>> says, pulling you towards the orphanage.
